<title>JAPAN: Mikuni assigns preliminary bond credit ratings.</title>
<headline>Mikuni assigns preliminary bond credit ratings.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mikuni and Co Ltd said on Friday it had assigned the following preliminary ratings to planned bond issues:</p>
<p>-BBB-</p>
<p>Anritsu Corp, 0.498 billion yen unsecured with warrants due 2002.</p>
<p>-BB-</p>
<p>Itochu Corp, 10 Billion yen unsecured due 2004.  </p>
<p>-B-</p>
<p>Heiwa Real Estate Co Ltd, 10 billion yen unsecured convertible due 2002.</p>
<p>Riken Corp, five billion yen unsecured convertible due 2001, private placement.</p>
</text>
